<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41 (FIM 183.95).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41 (FIM 183.95).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed unchanged at $41 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 183.95 markka. In Helsinki on Friday Nokia closed up 3.50 markka at 185.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed flat at $33-1/8 on Wall Street overnight. The price equals about 74.32 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed 0.10 markka down at 75.20 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS closed untraded in  New York. Its August 21 close on Wall Street was at $20-7/8 (93.68 markka). In Helsinki on Friday, Rauma closed 0.10 markka lower at 94.90.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 248</p>
